{"parse": {"title": "Dungeon", "pageid": 6955, "revid": 44215, "text": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p>Dungeons is a game mode that adds a choose your own adventure feeling to the game.\n</p><p>in order to start a dungeon, the player must have a <a href=\"/wiki/Items\" title=\"Items\">dungeon key</a> which can be obtained through <a href=\"/wiki/Quests\" title=\"Quests\">Daily Quests</a>, the gambler npc outside of <a href=\"/wiki/Summon\" title=\"Summon\">Summon</a>.\n</p><p>upon starting a dungeon, the key will be consumed, and the player will be granted 3 choices, the three Tiles on the bottom show you what loot you will get for winning that Match, the Tiles on top of the bottom Tiles show what games you will be able to choose next, choosing a different bottom Tile changes what your next Match options will be.\n</p><p>through playing the dungeon games the player is able to receive rewards like hoard, chests, and rare chests.\n</p><p>when choosing which game to play there will be smaller Tiles in the option Tile telling you what your rewards will be, theses Smaller tiles can be any of:\n</p>\n<div class=\"tabber wds-tabber\"><div class=\"wds-tabs__wrapper with-bottom-border\"><ul class=\"wds-tabs\"><li class=\"wds-tabs__tab wds-is-current\" data-hash=\"Hoard\"><div class=\"wds-tabs__tab-label\"><a href=\"#\">Hoard</a></div></li><li class=\"wds-tabs__tab\" data-hash=\"Shop\"><div class=\"wds-tabs__tab-label\"><a href=\"#\">Shop</a></div></li><li class=\"wds-tabs__tab\" data-hash=\"Curse\"><div class=\"wds-tabs__tab-label\"><a href=\"#\">Curse</a></div></li><li class=\"wds-tabs__tab\" data-hash=\"Chest\"><div class=\"wds-tabs__tab-label\"><a href=\"#\">Chest</a></div></li><li class=\"wds-tabs__tab\" data-hash=\"Rare_Chest\"><div class=\"wds-tabs__tab-label\"><a href=\"#\">Rare Chest</a></div></li><li class=\"wds-tabs__tab\" data-hash=\"Open\"><div class=\"wds-tabs__tab-label\"><a href=\"#\">Open</a></div></li><li class=\"wds-tabs__tab\" data-hash=\"Relics\"><div class=\"wds-tabs__tab-label\"><a href=\"#\">Relics</a></div></li></ul></div><div class=\"wds-tab__content wds-is-current\"><p>\nThe Hoard Tile, upon completion, will give you <a href=\"/wiki/Currencies\" title=\"Currencies\">Currency</a> called <span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Currencies\" title=\"Currencies\"><img alt=\"Hoard\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/animeadventures/images/c/c7/Hoard.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/24?cb=20250310214502\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-image-name=\"Hoard.png\" data-image-key=\"Hoard.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" /></a></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Currencies\" title=\"Currencies\"><span class=\"Tsh(Game) game-font-face\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(0deg, #6A0DAD, #A45DBB 50%, transparent); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\"> Dungeon Money</span></a>, which can be used in the Shop Tile</p></div><div class=\"wds-tab__content\"><p>\nthe shop Tile, upon completion of that game, will open a shop ui which allows you to spend your Hoard in return for blessings</p></div><div class=\"wds-tab__content\"><p>\nThe Curse Tile will add a curse to your Dungeon inventory. More information about the curse can be viewed by hovering over the tile.</p></div><div class=\"wds-tab__content\"><p>\nthe Chest Tile, upon completion of that game, will give the player a chest</p></div><div class=\"wds-tab__content\"><p>\nthe Rare Tile square, upon completion of that game, will give the player a rare chest</p></div><div class=\"wds-tab__content\"><p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">\n</p><p>Upon completion, you will have the ability to open Treasure Chests or Rare Chests. It is recommended to NOT open Rare Chests before the end, since you'll have a chance to get a Secret Unit.\n</p><p>Treasure Chests can give Stat Rerolls, <span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Currencies\" title=\"Currencies\"><img alt=\"Gems\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/animeadventures/images/d/d5/Gems.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/24?cb=20250109022450\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-image-name=\"Gems.png\" data-image-key=\"Gems.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" /></a></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Currencies\" title=\"Currencies\"><span class=\"Pos(r) Bg(Gems) Bgcp(text) Tfc(transparent) game-font-face\">150 Gems<span class=\"Tsh(Game) Pos(a) Start(0) Z(-1)\">150 Gems</span></span></a>, and <a href=\"/wiki/Traits\" title=\"Traits\">2 Star Remanents</a>.\n</p>\nRare Chests can give Stat Rerolls, <span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Currencies\" title=\"Currencies\"><img alt=\"Gems\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/animeadventures/images/d/d5/Gems.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/24?cb=20250109022450\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-image-name=\"Gems.png\" data-image-key=\"Gems.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" /></a></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Currencies\" title=\"Currencies\"><span class=\"Pos(r) Bg(Gems) Bgcp(text) Tfc(transparent) game-font-face\">450 Gems<span class=\"Tsh(Game) Pos(a) Start(0) Z(-1)\">450 Gems</span></span></a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Traits\" title=\"Traits\">5 Star Remanents</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Powerups\" title=\"Powerups\">Curse Tokens</a>, and the chance for a Secret Unit<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p></div><div class=\"wds-tab__content\"><p>\nthe Relic square, upon completion of that game, will open a Relic UI, where you can choose to take a relic or not, relics can give both curses and blessings, and the relic will tell you what the curses and blessings are</p></div></div>\n<div class=\"tabber wds-tabber\"><div class=\"wds-tabs__wrapper with-bottom-border\"><ul class=\"wds-tabs\"><li class=\"wds-tabs__tab wds-is-current\" data-hash=\".\"><div class=\"wds-tabs__tab-label\"><a href=\"#\">.</a></div></li><li class=\"wds-tabs__tab\" data-hash=\"Curses\"><div class=\"wds-tabs__tab-label\"><a href=\"#\">Curses</a></div></li><li class=\"wds-tabs__tab\" data-hash=\"Blessings\"><div class=\"wds-tabs__tab-label\"><a href=\"#\">Blessings</a></div></li></ul></div><div class=\"wds-tab__content wds-is-current\"><p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p></div><div class=\"wds-tab__content\"><p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">\n</p><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Curses\">Curses</span></h2>\n<table class=\"article-table\" style=\"border: 20px solid #302D40; border-radius:2em; overflow:hidden; text-align:center; width:550px; box-shadow: 5px 5px 15px #a3f7e8; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th><span style=\"display: inline-block; min-width: 300px;\"><center>name<center>\n</center></center></span></th>\n<th><center>effect<center>\n</center></center></th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><center>curse of vamperism<center><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/animeadventures/images/7/72/Curse_vamperism.png/revision/latest?cb=20250310214339\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Curse vamperism\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"76\" height=\"76\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Curse vamperism.png\" data-image-key=\"Curse_vamperism.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/animeadventures/images/7/72/Curse_vamperism.png/revision/latest?cb=20250310214339\" /></a></span>\n</center></center></td>\n<td>enemies will have +3% regen\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><center>curse of Wind<center><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/animeadventures/images/f/f2/Curse_wind.png/revision/latest?cb=20250310214738\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Curse wind\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"80\" height=\"80\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Curse wind.png\" data-image-key=\"Curse_wind.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/animeadventures/images/f/f2/Curse_wind.png/revision/latest?cb=20250310214738\" /></a></span>\n</center></center></td>\n<td>enemies will move +25% faster\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><center>curse of burst<center><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/animeadventures/images/c/ce/Curse_Burst.png/revision/latest?cb=20250310214430\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Curse Burst\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"76\" height=\"76\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Curse Burst.png\" data-image-key=\"Curse_Burst.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/animeadventures/images/c/ce/Curse_Burst.png/revision/latest?cb=20250310214430\" /></a></span>\n</center></center></td>\n<td>enemies will have +100% chance to have the burst trait\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><center>curse of Shielding<center><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/animeadventures/images/6/62/Curse_Shielding.png/revision/latest?cb=20250310214710\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Curse Shielding\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"80\" height=\"80\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Curse Shielding.png\" data-image-key=\"Curse_Shielding.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/animeadventures/images/6/62/Curse_Shielding.png/revision/latest?cb=20250310214710\" /></a></span>\n</center></center></td>\n<td>enemies will have +3 shield\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><center>curse of Regen<center><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/animeadventures/images/7/77/Curse_Regen.png/revision/latest?cb=20250310214721\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Curse Regen\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"80\" height=\"80\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Curse Regen.png\" data-image-key=\"Curse_Regen.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/animeadventures/images/7/77/Curse_Regen.png/revision/latest?cb=20250310214721\" /></a></span>\n</center></center></td>\n<td>enemies will have +1% regen\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><center>curse of Armor<center><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:Error mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Special:Upload?wpDestFile=Curse_Armor.png\" class=\"new\" title=\"File:Curse Armor.png\"><span class=\"mw-file-element mw-broken-media\">File:Curse Armor.png</span></a></span>\n</center></center></td>\n<td>enemies will have a +100% chance to spawn with armr trait\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><center>curse of money<center><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/animeadventures/images/b/bb/Curse_Money.png/revision/latest?cb=20250310214402\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Curse Money\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"80\" height=\"80\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Curse Money.png\" data-image-key=\"Curse_Money.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/animeadventures/images/b/bb/Curse_Money.png/revision/latest?cb=20250310214402\" /></a></span>\n</center></center></td>\n<td>-10% Hoard drops\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><center>curse of Frenzy<center><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:Error mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Special:Upload?wpDestFile=Curse_Frenzy.png\" class=\"new\" title=\"File:Curse Frenzy.png\"><span class=\"mw-file-element mw-broken-media\">File:Curse Frenzy.png</span></a></span>\n</center></center></td>\n<td>enemies will move +50% faster\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><center>curse of Flight<center><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/animeadventures/images/e/ee/Curse_Flight.png/revision/latest?cb=20250310214841\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Curse Flight\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"80\" height=\"80\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Curse Flight.png\" data-image-key=\"Curse_Flight.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/animeadventures/images/e/ee/Curse_Flight.png/revision/latest?cb=20250310214841\" /></a></span>\n</center></center></td>\n<td>enemies will have a +20% chance to spawn with flying trait\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><center>curse of Chaos<center><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/animeadventures/images/2/2d/Curse_Chaos.png/revision/latest?cb=20250310214349\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Curse Chaos\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"83\" height=\"83\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Curse Chaos.png\" data-image-key=\"Curse_Chaos.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/animeadventures/images/2/2d/Curse_Chaos.png/revision/latest?cb=20250310214349\" /></a></span>\n</center></center></td>\n<td>All Curses are random\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><center>curse of Eruption<center><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/animeadventures/images/8/8c/Curse_Eruption.png/revision/latest?cb=20250310214447\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Curse Eruption\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"76\" height=\"76\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Curse Eruption.png\" data-image-key=\"Curse_Eruption.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/animeadventures/images/8/8c/Curse_Eruption.png/revision/latest?cb=20250310214447\" /></a></span>\n</center></center></td>\n<td>enemies will have +24 explosive death range\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><center>curse of Health<center><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/animeadventures/images/3/31/Curse_Health.png/revision/latest?cb=20250310214410\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Curse Health\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"80\" height=\"80\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Curse Health.png\" data-image-key=\"Curse_Health.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/animeadventures/images/3/31/Curse_Health.png/revision/latest?cb=20250310214410\" /></a></span>\n</center></center></td>\n<td>enemies will have +80% hp\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><center>curse of Shopping<center><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/animeadventures/images/7/7c/Curse_Shopping.png/revision/latest?cb=20250310214730\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Curse Shopping\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"80\" height=\"80\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Curse Shopping.png\" data-image-key=\"Curse_Shopping.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/animeadventures/images/7/7c/Curse_Shopping.png/revision/latest?cb=20250310214730\" /></a></span>\n</center></center></td>\n<td>+10% shop prices\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><center>curse of Explosion<center><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:Error mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Special:Upload?wpDestFile=Curse_Explosion.png\" class=\"new\" title=\"File:Curse Explosion.png\"><span class=\"mw-file-element mw-broken-media\">File:Curse Explosion.png</span></a></span>\n</center></center></td>\n<td>enemies will have +12 explosive death range\n</td></tr></tbody></table><p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p></div><div class=\"wds-tab__content\"><p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">\n</p><table class=\"article-table\" style=\"border: 20px solid #302D40; border-radius:2em; overflow:hidden; text-align:center; width:550px; box-shadow: 5px 5px 15px #a3f7e8; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th><span style=\"display: inline-block; min-width: 300px;\"><center>name<center>\n</center></center></span></th>\n<th><center>effect<center>\n</center></center></th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><center>Mask of Riches<center>image\n</center></center></td>\n<td>towers get -50% upgrade/placement costs\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><center>Golden Mushroom<center>image\n</center></center></td>\n<td>towers will have -30% upgrade and placement costs\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><center>Golden Branch<center>image\n</center></center></td>\n<td>towers get -15% upgrade/placement costs\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><center>Genie Lamp<center>image\n</center></center></td>\n<td>+100% chest luck\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><center>Golden Fishhook<center>image\n</center></center></td>\n<td>+40% chest luck\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><center>Fish Hook<center>image\n</center></center></td>\n<td>+20% chest luck\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><center>Archmage's Hat<center>image\n</center></center></td>\n<td>+250% magic dmg\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><center>Magic Tome<center>image\n</center></center></td>\n<td>+100% Magic dmg\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><center>Mage Coat<center>image\n</center></center></td>\n<td>+50% magic dmg\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><center>Aures Maul<center>image\n</center></center></td>\n<td>+200% physical dmg\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><center>Headsplitter<center>image\n</center></center></td>\n<td>+75% Physical dmg\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><center>Axe<center>image\n</center></center></td>\n<td>+50% physical crit chance\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><center>Solar Clearver<center>image\n</center></center></td>\n<td>+100% physical crit chance\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><center>Sylvanthorn<center>image\n</center></center></td>\n<td>+150% range\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><center>Elf Bow<center>image\n</center></center></td>\n<td>+50% range\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><center>Reaper Sythe<center>image\n</center></center></td>\n<td>towers deal +75% boss damage\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><center>Clesestial Blade<center>image\n</center></center></td>\n<td>+777% true dmg\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><center>Scimitar<center>image\n</center></center></td>\n<td>+75% attack\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><center>Sword<center>image\n</center></center></td>\n<td>+30% dmg\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><center>Ninja Belt<center>image\n</center></center></td>\n<td>-12% attack speed\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><center>Glacial Axe<center>image\n</center></center></td>\n<td>enemies will move -30% Slower\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><center>Philosophers Stone<center>image\n</center></center></td>\n<td>instantly convert all chests to rare chests\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><center>Shimmering Moon Fragment<center>image\n</center></center></td>\n<td>+1 star <a href=\"/wiki/Traits\" title=\"Traits\">Star Remnant</a> to each chest you open\n</td></tr></tbody></table><p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p></div></div>\n<p><br />\nif the player loses a match, the player will have 4 more chances to win that match, if the player fails to do so, they lose the dungeon\n</p><p>in order to complete a dungeon, the play must win 20 games\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached 